#: src-en/data/events_special_eg_miracle_seekers.xml:2309
msgid ""
"data/events_special_eg_miracle_seekers.xml$//event[@name=\"EG_QUEST_ALLIANCE_AGREEMENT_2_RESULT\"]/text"
